  "body": [
    "The first Fréscopa machine with a feel for your mornings. It learns what you love, reads the shape of your day, and quietly takes care of the rest.",
    "Finish — Cream",
    "Free delivery, and we'll set it up for you.",
    "Two-year workshop guarantee.",
    "Thirty mornings to fall for it, or send it back.",
    "HOW IT ACTUALLY WORKS",
    "Not a preset menu, and not a guess. The Atelier works the way a good barista does — it pays attention, remembers, and adjusts. Four quiet steps, running every morning.",
    "Grind, flow, strength, temperature.",
    "A profile per person, refined daily.",
    "Time, calendar, weather, who's up.",
    "Warms up, pours, reorders.",
    "A ring of sensors watches every extraction — the grind size, how fast the water flows, the strength in the cup, and the temperature at the group head. The same signals a barista feels by hand, read hundreds of times a second.",
    "YOUR FLAVOUR DNA AND MORNING ROUTINES STAY ON YOUR MACHINE AND YOUR ACCOUNT. YOU CAN REVIEW WHAT IT HAS LEARNED, CORRECT IT, OR WIPE IT CLEAN, ANY TIME.",
    "SEE IT IN THE MORNING",
    "THE CLAIMS, ANSWERED",
    "From your first cup it tracks strength, temperature and milk, and settles into your preference within about a week.",
    "EVERY DETAIL",
    "The Atelier machine",
    "Starter bag of house beans, 250 g",
    "Reusable pod and scoop",
    "Water filter cartridge",
    "Quick-start card",
    "Power cable",
    "HOW IT LEARNS YOU",
    "We call the picture the Atelier builds your flavour DNA. Tap a profile to see how a Tuesday, a slow Sunday, and a late evening each pour a little differently.",
    "Brisk and a little bolder. Enough to meet the day, never so much it rushes you.",
    "WHAT OWNERS SAY",
    "from 214 verified owners",
    "BEFORE YOU DECIDE",
    "The small doubts that keep a good machine in its box. Here's the honest answer to each.",
    "Ask us anything else",
    "Not at all. Delivery includes a full setup, so it's pouring before we leave. If anything ever feels off, we'll talk you through it.",
    "WAYS TO BUY",
    "The machine, delivered and set up in your kitchen. Everything it needs to start learning you.",
    "The machine, plus house beans delivered as you need them for a year. It reorders; you never run dry.",
    "Adds the milk jug, tamper, and two ceramic cups — for the mornings you want to do it by hand.",
    "PAIRS WELL WITH",
    "COFFEE The house pour Our everyday blend, coaxed a little rounder for the season. $18 Add to cart →",
    "Our everyday blend, coaxed a little rounder for the season.",
    "TEA Honeybush and orange peel Caffeine-free, and quietly sweet. Made for slowing down. $14 Add to cart →",
    "Caffeine-free, and quietly sweet. Made for slowing down.",
    "JUICE Cold-pressed citrus Three oranges, one grapefruit, and a whisper of ginger. $10 Add to cart →",
    "Three oranges, one grapefruit, and a whisper of ginger."
  ],
